=='''Overview'''==
The '''Scientist Toilet''' is a [[Rare|{{Rare|Rare}}]] unit. 

=='''Appearance'''==
'''Its appearace is very similar and accurate to the original series, having a jetpack, 6 support mechanical claws, a front shield, a tablet near the base, and a back-laser which does the main damage.'''

=='''Obtainment'''==
'''Scientist Toilet can be obtaied from the [[Advanced Toilet Crate]] for 250 coins, with a 50% chance.'''

